P0 holds
Split P/I/S + HSS-lite, Path / PAI / 100 Trying, WWW-Authenticate relay, BindingStore one live Contact + PG flow columns (received_host/port/transport), ISPN DIST_SYNC CMP, FreeSWITCH mandatory, charging master off.

Datastore is PostgreSQL only (db-kind=postgresql, Flyway V9, dedicated elisa DB, quarkus-jdbc-postgresql — no H2). EPC uses postgres-epc / epc — never H2, never share USSDGW. Ship dist/elisa/ on JDK 25. Never clobber host configs/.

P0 does not mean
Not Clearwater parity. Not Chronos. Not UICC AKA at scale. Not reachable UEs behind NAT on a host phone. Not 10k INVITE/s. Not 1M SIP TPS. Not EPC VoLTE (Rx/N5 still out of Elisa). Not GTP attach GO.

production-p0.md status line is lab nn, not a customer cutover. flowNextHopUri unit tests are not a Linphone prove.

