P1 charging is not a silent flip
sf.ims.feature.charging is still false. Turning it on without a Rf peer and CGRates URL will soft-fail to logs. That is honest, not production charging. Prove: INVITE ACR START, BYE ACR STOP, CDRsV1 HTTP 200, pending-charge settle with no double-debit.
EPC GTP-C — P0 / P1
Control plane is vendor ra-gtpv2c + GtpGatewaySbb in epc-host. User-plane GTP-U is Linux, not the JVM. Inventory taken from Mobius mobius-software-ltd/gtp (Java 8, Netty UDP, AGPL-3.0): extract header and procedure shape only — do not depend on or copy that tree.

