Hút máu from Mobius (kept)
Echo and Version Not Supported encode T=0. Decode honors the T bit. Unknown message types become UNKNOWN instead of throwing. Opaque TLVs are kept; a truncated tail is dropped. Recovery IE is mandatory on Echo. Grouped Bearer Context is nested TLV (IE 93).

~205 GTPv2 message classes and Netty epoll reuseport stay in Mobius. We keep a thin RA + SBB procedures.

Not taken from Mobius
AGPL sources, Java 8 baseline, commons-logging / log4j 1.2, Netty GTP-U, GTPTag, 200+ generated message classes, SO_REUSEPORT multi-bind. epc-host stays JDK 25 + DatagramSocket + virtual thread.

Depend on nhanth87 ra-gtpv2c only. Never vendor the Mobius jar.

GTP P0 is not attach
Echo T=0 unblocks an MME ping. Create Session encodes grouped Bearer Context (IE 93). RAB 171 and DDN 177 ack are unit-tested. There is still no MME CSR on UDP :2123 and no Linux GTP-U packet forward. Do not claim EPC attach GO from unit tests.
